    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">By the consolidation of 10,000,000 preference shares of a par value of US$0.0001 each into US$400,000 preference shares of a par value of US$0.0025 each.</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
