while considered present for the purposes of establishing a quorum, will not count as a vote cast at the Extraordinary Meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 63.55pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS RECOMMENDS A VOTE &ldquo;FOR&rdquo;
PROPOSAL 2, TO APPROVE THE <BR>
INCREASE OF AUTHORIZED SHARES AS DESCRIBED IN THIS PROPOSAL 2</B></P>

